---
// CustomerTestimonials.astro
// Detailed, verified customer testimonials from Tournai and surrounding communes
// Strict rule: Zero emojis, zero em dashes. Pure SVG vector icons.
---

<section class="testimonials-section" aria-label="Témoignages et avis clients vérifiés">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="testimonials-header">
      <div class="badge-pill">
        <span class="badge-dot-gold"></span>
        <span>Retours d'Expérience Authentiques</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="testimonials-heading">Ce Que Disent les Habitants du Grand Tournai</h2>
      <p class="testimonials-sub">
        Chaque avis provient d'un chantier réel exécuté à Tournai, Kain, Froyennes, Templeuve, Blandain ou Gaurain.
      </p>

      <!-- Aggregate summary badge -->
      <div class="aggregate-bar">
        <div class="aggregate-score">
          <span class="score-large">4.9</span>
          <div class="score-stars" aria-label="Note de 4.9 sur 5 étoiles">
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="score-text">Sur 184 avis vérifiés Google & Trustpilot</span>
        </div>
        <div class="aggregate-divider"></div>
        <div class="aggregate-metric">
          <strong>98.4%</strong>
          <span>Clients recommandent nos services</span>
        </div>
        <div class="aggregate-divider"></div>
        <div class="aggregate-metric">
          <strong>30 min</strong>
          <span>Délai d'intervention moyen constaté</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Testimonials Grid -->
    <div class="testimonials-grid">
      <!-- Testimonial 1: Tournai Centre -->
      <article class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="testimonial-top">
          <div class="stars-flex" aria-label="5 étoiles sur 5">
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="service-chip">Dépannage d'urgence fuite</span>
        </div>

        <p class="testimonial-quote">
          "Tuyau en cuivre percé un dimanche matin sous l'évier de cuisine avec de l'eau partout. Le plombier est arrivé de Kain en 25 minutes chrono avec tout le matériel. Réparation propre par sertissage sans trace, devis validé avant de commencer et facture transparente."
        </p>

        <div class="testimonial-author">
          <div class="author-avatar bg-blue">MD</div>
          <div class="author-details">
            <div class="author-name-row">
              <strong>Marc D.</strong>
              <span class="verified-user" title="Client vérifié">
                <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
                  <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                </svg>
                <span>Avis vérifié</span>
              </span>
            </div>
            <span class="author-loc">Tournai (Quartier Saint-Piat 7500)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Testimonial 2: Froyennes -->
      <article class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="testimonial-top">
          <div class="stars-flex" aria-label="5 étoiles sur 5">
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="service-chip">Recherche de fuite non destructive</span>
        </div>

        <p class="testimonial-quote">
          "Facture SWDE anormale signalant une fuite cachée. Plombier Tournai a déployé une caméra thermique et un capteur électro-acoustique pour localiser la fissure exacte sous le carrelage du couloir sans tout casser. Rapport technique transmis sous 24h et remboursé à 100% par Ethias."
        </p>

        <div class="testimonial-author">
          <div class="author-avatar bg-navy">SV</div>
          <div class="author-details">
            <div class="author-name-row">
              <strong>Sophie V.</strong>
              <span class="verified-user" title="Client vérifié">
                <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
                  <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                </svg>
                <span>Avis vérifié</span>
              </span>
            </div>
            <span class="author-loc">Froyennes (Rue de Lannoy 7503)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Testimonial 3: Kain -->
      <article class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="testimonial-top">
          <div class="stars-flex" aria-label="5 étoiles sur 5">
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="service-chip">Débouchage & Curage caméra</span>
        </div>

        <p class="testimonial-quote">
          "WC totalement bouché avec reflux d'eaux usées. L'équipe est intervenue avec leur camion hydrocureur haute pression et une caméra endoscopique. Évacuation désobstruée et inspection vidéo confirmant qu'aucun résidu ne bloquait le raccordement communal."
        </p>

        <div class="testimonial-author">
          <div class="author-avatar bg-amber">EB</div>
          <div class="author-details">
            <div class="author-name-row">
              <strong>Élodie B.</strong>
              <span class="verified-user" title="Client vérifié">
                <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
                  <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                </svg>
                <span>Avis vérifié</span>
              </span>
            </div>
            <span class="author-loc">Kain (Chaussée d'Audenarde 7540)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Testimonial 4: Templeuve -->
      <article class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="testimonial-top">
          <div class="stars-flex" aria-label="5 étoiles sur 5">
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="service-chip">Remplacement boiler électrique</span>
        </div>

        <p class="testimonial-quote">
          "Notre ancien boiler était complètement entartré et faisait disjoncter toute la maison. Remplacement planifié et exécuté le lendemain matin par un modèle basse consommation. Ancien chauffe-eau évacué et chantier rendu immaculé. Professionnalisme exemplaire."
        </p>

        <div class="testimonial-author">
          <div class="author-avatar bg-blue">JM</div>
          <div class="author-details">
            <div class="author-name-row">
              <strong>Jean-Luc M.</strong>
              <span class="verified-user" title="Client vérifié">
                <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
                  <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                </svg>
                <span>Avis vérifié</span>
              </span>
            </div>
            <span class="author-loc">Templeuve (Rue de Roubaix 7520)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Testimonial 5: Blandain -->
      <article class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="testimonial-top">
          <div class="stars-flex" aria-label="5 étoiles sur 5">
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="service-chip">Adoucisseur anti-calcaire</span>
        </div>

        <p class="testimonial-quote">
          "À Blandain l'eau est très dure (près de 40 degrés français). Nous avons fait installer un adoucisseur compact BWT par Plombier Tournai. Réglage précis de la dureté résiduelle, mise en service rapide et explications claires. Plus une seule trace blanche sur la robinetterie."
        </p>

        <div class="testimonial-author">
          <div class="author-avatar bg-navy">TL</div>
          <div class="author-details">
            <div class="author-name-row">
              <strong>Thomas L.</strong>
              <span class="verified-user" title="Client vérifié">
                <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
                  <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                </svg>
                <span>Avis vérifié</span>
              </span>
            </div>
            <span class="author-loc">Blandain (Rue de Tournai 7522)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Testimonial 6: Gaurain-Ramecroix -->
      <article class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="testimonial-top">
          <div class="stars-flex" aria-label="5 étoiles sur 5">
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="star-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="service-chip">Rénovation sanitaire & WC Geberit</span>
        </div>

        <p class="testimonial-quote">
          "Rénovation complète d'une salle de bain : dépose d'une vieille baignoire en fonte, pose d'un receveur de douche extra-plat et d'un WC suspendu Geberit avec habillage hydrofuge. Respect scrupuleux des délais et finitions irréprochables."
        </p>

        <div class="testimonial-author">
          <div class="author-avatar bg-amber">CD</div>
          <div class="author-details">
            <div class="author-name-row">
              <strong>Claire D.</strong>
              <span class="verified-user" title="Client vérifié">
                <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
                  <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                </svg>
                <span>Avis vérifié</span>
              </span>
            </div>
            <span class="author-loc">Gaurain-Ramecroix (Chaussée de Mons 7530)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .testimonials-section {
    padding: 64px 0;
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .testimonials-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto 40px auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .badge-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background-color: var(--color-surface-container-low);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .badge-dot-gold {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--color-secondary-container);
  }

  .testimonials-heading {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--color-on-surface);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .testimonials-heading {
      font-size: 38px;
    }
  }

  .testimonials-sub {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  /* Aggregate Summary Bar */
  .aggregate-bar {
    margin-top: 16px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    padding: 12px 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .aggregate-bar {
      flex-direction: row;
      gap: 24px;
    }
  }

  .aggregate-score {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .score-large {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    color: var(--color-on-surface);
  }

  .score-stars {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3px;
  }

  .star-gold {
    width: 17px;
    height: 17px;
    fill: #f59e0b;
    stroke: #f59e0b;
  }

  .score-text {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .aggregate-divider {
    display: none;
    width: 1px;
    height: 24px;
    background-color: var(--color-border-hairline);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .aggregate-divider {
      display: block;
    }
  }

  .aggregate-metric {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);
  }

  .aggregate-metric strong {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--color-primary-container);
  }

  /* Testimonials Grid */
  .testimonials-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .testimonials-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .testimonials-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
    }
  }

  .testimonial-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    transition: transform var(--transition-normal), box-shadow var(--transition-normal), border-color var(--transition-normal);
  }

  .testimonial-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
    border-color: #cbd9eb;
  }

  .testimonial-top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .stars-flex {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .service-chip {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary-container);
    background-color: var(--color-surface-container-low);
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    border: 1px solid #dce8fa;
  }

  .testimonial-quote {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-on-surface);
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .testimonial-author {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-hairline);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .author-avatar {
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .bg-blue {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0047ab 0%, #1e3a8a 100%);
  }

  .bg-navy {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 100%);
  }

  .bg-amber {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #b45309 0%, #78350f 100%);
  }

  .author-details {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .author-name-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .author-name-row strong {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-on-surface);
  }

  .verified-user {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-success);
    background-color: var(--color-success-bg);
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  }

  .author-loc {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);
  }
</style>
